2:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://dottodotfreeprintables.com/nl/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Uae\",\"item\":\"https://dottodotfreeprintables.com/nl/uae/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Boerj Khalifa\",\"item\":\"https://dottodotfreeprintables.com/nl/uae/burj-khalifa-dot-to-dot-puzzle/\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CreativeWork\",\"name\":\"Boerj Khalifa\",\"description\":\"Klim één lijn tegelijk naar het hoogste gebouw ter wereld. Deze 60-punten Burj Khalifa afdrukbare PDF brengt de geografie van Dubai naar kinderen van 5-9 jaar.\",\"educationalUse\":\"Fine motor skills, number sequencing\"}"}}],["$","main",null,{"children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"breadcrumb","aria-label":"Broodkruimel","children":[["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/nl/","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":14,"height":14,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-house","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","5wwlr5",{"d":"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"}],["$","path","1d0kgt",{"d":"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"}],"$undefined"]}]," ","Thuis"]}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":" › "}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/nl/uae/","children":"Uae"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":" › "}],["$","span",null,{"aria-current":"page","children":"Boerj Khalifa"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"maxWidth":1180,"margin":"0 auto","padding":"0 24px 20px"},"children":null}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-page-layout section","style":{"paddingTop":0},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-preview-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-preview-card","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"","srcSet":"$undefined","sizes":"$undefined","alt":"Recordbrekende Burj Khalifa-toren die omhoog rijst via 60 genummerde printbare stippen","width":540,"height":420,"loading":"eager","fetchPriority":"high","decoding":"async","className":"$undefined","style":{"width":"100%","height":"auto","display":"block","borderRadius":16}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-side-ad","children":null}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"puzzle-details-col","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":["Free ","Uae"," Printable"]}],["$","h1",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem)"},"children":"Boerj Khalifa Dot-to-Dot Printable"}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--muted)","fontSize":"1.05rem","lineHeight":1.65,"margin":"14px 0 20px"},"children":"Verbind 60 punten om de Burj Khalifa te onthullen, de recordbrekende wolkenkrabber die boven de stad Dubai uittorent. Deze gemakkelijke puzzel is perfect voor jonge leerlingen die getalvolgorde oefenen terwijl ze het hoogste gebouw op aarde ontdekken."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"meta-chips","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"chip","children":["Ages:"," ",""]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"chip","children":["Dots:"," 1–",0]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"chip chip--free","children":"100% Free"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"margin":"16px 0"},"children":[["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":8,"fontSize":"0.9rem"},"children":"Difficulty"}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"display":"flex","alignItems":"center","gap":10},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"difficulty","role":"img","aria-label":"Moeilijkheidsgraad 1 uit 3","style":{"margin":0},"children":[["$","span","1",{"className":"on"}],["$","span","2",{"className":""}],["$","span","3",{"className":""}]]}],["$","span",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.85rem","fontWeight":800,"color":"var(--muted)"},"children":"Easy"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"fun-fact-box","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1.3rem"},"aria-hidden":"true","children":"!"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Fun fact:"}]," ","De Burj Khalifa is het hoogste gebouw ter wereld, met een hoogte van meer dan 828 meter (2.717 voet)!"]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"style":{"margin":"20px 0 16px"},"children":null}],["$","p",null,{"className":"asset-note","children":"Printable PDF path is not present in the export JSON."}],"$L10",["$","$L11",null,{"title":"Boerj Khalifa Verbinden de Punten Afdrukbaar - Gratis PDF","imageUrl":"","compact":true}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"0.8rem","color":"var(--muted)","marginTop":10,"lineHeight":1.5},"children":"No sign-up needed. Opens as a PDF. Print on US Letter (8.5 × 11 inch) or A4 paper. Free for home and classroom use."}],["$","$Lf",null,{"href":"/nl/uae/","style":{"display":"inline-flex","alignItems":"center","gap":6,"marginTop":18,"fontWeight":800,"color":"#d94f70","textDecoration":"none"},"children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1l729n",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"}],["$","path","x3x0zl",{"d":"M19 12H5"}],"$undefined"]}]," Back to all ","Uae"," puzzles"]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"dot-guide","className":"section","style":{"paddingTop":0,"maxWidth":800,"margin":"0 auto","padding":"0 24px 48px"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem)","marginBottom":12},"children":["Boerj Khalifa"," Dot-to-Dot Puzzle Guide"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--muted)","lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":28},"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"De Burj Khalifa is het hoogste gebouw dat ooit door mensenhanden is gebouwd – een naaldvormige toren die de hemel boven Dubai doorboort. Het gelaagde, spiraalvormige ontwerp is geïnspireerd op een woestijnbloem genaamd Hymenocallis, en het draagt ​​de titel van hoogste gebouw ter wereld sinds de opening in 2010. Deze puzzel van 60 stippen volgt het torenhoge silhouet van de basis tot de spits. Vind stip 1 en laten we de hemel bereiken!"}}],[["$","div","1–12",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["1–12"," — ","De torenspits"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Begin bij punt 1 en verbind deze met punt 12 om de dunne, puntige torenspits helemaal bovenaan de toren te tekenen. Dit smalle gedeelte vereist vanaf het begin zorgvuldige, gecontroleerde potloodstreken – een goede opwarming voor de bredere vormen hieronder. Moedig kinderen aan om langzaam te tekenen en de lijnen recht en hoog te houden."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"De spits alleen al is ongeveer 244 meter hoog – bijna net zo hoog als sommige complete wolkenkrabbers in andere steden! Hij bevat een telecommunicatieantenne en is een van de redenen waarom de Burj Khalifa zoveel hoogterecords in handen heeft. Bekijk alle hoogterecords op <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Burj_Khalifa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Wikipedia's Burj Khalifa-pagina</a>."]}]]}]]}],["$","div","13–24",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["13–24"," — ","De bovenste verdiepingen"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Teken vanaf punt 13 tot en met punt 24 de smaller wordende, trapsgewijze gedeelten bovenaan de toren. Kinderen oefenen met het tekenen van een vorm die geleidelijk kleiner wordt naarmate hij hoger wordt. Dit is een fantastische manier om over perspectief te praten en te laten zien hoe gebouwen naar de hemel toe smaller kunnen worden."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Het gebouw telt 163 verdiepingen – meer dan welk ander gebouw ter wereld ook op het moment dat het werd voltooid. Het heeft ook 's werelds hoogste observatiedek, genaamd 'At the Top', op de 148e verdieping."]}]]}]]}],["$","div","25–36",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["25–36"," — ","De middelste spiraal"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Teken de stippen 25 tot en met 36 om het middelste gedeelte te tekenen, waar het spiraalvormige, trapsgewijze patroon van de toren het best te zien is. Dit gedeelte beloont nauwkeurige aandacht, omdat de terugspringende hoeken en hoeken meerdere keren van richting veranderen. Dit biedt kinderen een goede oefening in het volgen van een complexere vorm."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Het ontwerp van de Burj Khalifa is geïnspireerd op de Hymenocallis, een woestijnbloem met lange, slanke bloemblaadjes die vanuit het midden spiraalvormig naar buiten groeien. De architecten gebruikten deze natuurlijke vorm om het gebouw te beschermen tegen de sterke woestijnwinden."]}]]}]]}],["$","div","37–48",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["37–48"," — ","De lagere toren"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Verbind de stippen 37 tot en met 48 om het bredere onderste gedeelte van de toren in te vullen. Dit is een van de grotere delen van de puzzel, waardoor kinderen hun concentratie en geduld kunnen ontwikkelen terwijl de volledige hoogte van de toren op de pagina vorm begint te krijgen."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__icon","aria-hidden":"true","children":"💡"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-fact__body","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"guide-fact__label","children":"Fun fact!"}],["$","br",null,{}],"Voor de bouw van de Burj Khalifa werd genoeg beton gebruikt om een ​​trottoir van meer dan 48 kilometer aan te leggen, en genoeg wapeningsstaal om, als het achter elkaar gelegd zou worden, meer dan een kwart van de omtrek van de aarde te overbruggen!"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","49–60",{"style":{"marginBottom":24,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--blue-light, #63b3ed)"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"style":{"fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":800,"marginBottom":6},"children":["49–60"," — ","De basis"]}],["$","p",null,{"style":{"lineHeight":1.7,"marginBottom":6},"children":"Maak de puzzel af door de stippen 49 tot en met 60 met elkaar te verbinden om de brede basis van de toren te tekenen waar deze de grond raakt. Nog maar twaalf stippen te gaan – moedig de kinderen aan om 